 "insight": [
  "In 2005, Luxembourg's imports totaled 18.15 billion euros, with Belgium as the largest source country, providing 26.9% of imports.",
  "The top three import partners were Belgium, Germany, and China, together accounting for 59.6% of total imports.",
  "Belgium supplied 4.88 billion euros worth of goods, followed by Germany with 3.69 billion euros and China with 2.25 billion euros.",
  "Imports from France and the Netherlands were also significant, at 9.4% and 4.9% respectively.",
  "Note that 4.0% of imports came from undisclosed partners, which are included in totals but not assigned to specific countries, and values are nominal euros not adjusted for inflation."
 ],
